    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76cc0e91e01738c7499a916c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我和艾尼斯风神一起\n为了朝“有马纪念”迈进而做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a58f9bf9cb98f1557b2fb5b5ec819a2fef607697448800f64753bfd70f04899",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
