      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ab3701aa61a1085ce0cec7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有些人看到地方出身的赛马娘来到中央，\n像灰姑娘般一步一步直上青云，\n为那戏剧性的成功之路而疯狂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c4d04d34fa3f38eb5e1e290d52c1ffad3c3d002305d5d65a0b98b59b631f2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031324.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d20a1b26398594106b7e0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有些人则是看到名门出身的赛马娘为了\n家族的荣耀展现毅力及魄力的姿态，进而\n投射自身的憧憬和理想，对她们充满期望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cb2572c2e0c90d623c5e72997c056e3a531ec8c85932e1e391fecf9105ec15e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1031/storytimeline_501031324.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
